{"slug":"donchian_perp","doc":"Leveraged LONG/SHORT breakout on liquid perp majors \u2014 the hawk archetype.\n\n    LONG  on a fresh 1h close ABOVE the N-bar channel high while price is above\n          the 50-EMA, on a volume expansion.\n    SHORT on a fresh 1h close BELOW the N-bar channel low while price is below\n          the 50-EMA, on a volume expansion.\n\n    Direction is regime-gated INSIDE the strategy (is_actionable lets the perp\n    book run in every regime): longs in TREND_UP/CHOP, shorts in\n    TREND_DOWN/RISK_OFF/CHOP. Executed as a leveraged perp (venue=\"perp\") via\n    TWAK/Aster, so the agent profits when the market FALLS \u2014 the structural edge\n    the long-only spot book lacks, and the difference between \"breakeven in a\n    down week\" and \"wins the week\".\n\n    Stops are kept in PRICE terms but sized for leverage: a ~3% price stop at 3x\n    is ~9% on margin, while the ~33%-away liquidation price is never approached.","tier":"archive","trusted":false,"trustedMinTrades":30,"evidence":{"btcKnown":{"return_pct":-1.42,"max_dd_pct":2.33,"sharpe":-0.809,"expectancy_r":-0.0312,"trades":108},"btcUnseen":{"return_pct":-2.92,"max_dd_pct":3.64,"sharpe":-2.145,"expectancy_r":-0.1288,"trades":92},"portfolioKnown":{"return_pct":-7.82,"max_dd_pct":12.82,"sharpe":-1.185,"expectancy_r":-0.0472,"trades":499,"win_rate":45.49,"profit_factor":0.893,"fees_usd":5.82},"portfolioUnseen":{"return_pct":-5.42,"max_dd_pct":7.95,"sharpe":-1.134,"sortino":-0.541,"expectancy_r":-0.033,"trades":380,"win_rate":44.21,"wins":168,"losses":212,"profit_factor":0.888,"fees_usd":4.36,"avg_win_usd":0.153,"avg_loss_usd":-0.1366,"best_trade_pct":8.34,"worst_trade_pct":-3.71,"avg_hold_bars":9.2},"sensitivityPassed":"0/5","sensitivityOf":5,"sensitivityDetail":[-0.1288,-0.1288,-0.1288,-0.1288,-0.1288],"doubleCostExpectancyR":-0.1575,"doubleCostReturnPct":-3.98,"crossAsset":{"ETH":-0.0229,"SOL":-0.0796},"survives":false,"failedOn":["OOS","Sens","comm2x","Multi","unseen return <